# 2026/06/15

## 01:22

I found an original ScritchUI bug from 2024! Well. Essentially, it is an OR
on the wrong side of a parenthesis. That is
`sjme_error_is(error = ... || out == NULL))` instead of
`sjme_error_is(error = ...) || out == NULL)`. This has only appeared 12 times
in the code base overall, but it has been fixed!